// In slot 10:
// 0x0000000000000300 0000000000015180 0000000000000040 0000000000001c20
// Let us verify how Solidity packs:
// struct or sequential variables:
// delayBlocks (uint64)
// futureBlocks (uint64)
// delaySeconds (uint64)
// futureSeconds (uint64)
